<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="section" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #07381b 0%, #0d562b 100%); color: #fff; padding: 60px 0;">
  <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
    <span class="hero-badge" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">Form Factors &amp; Styles</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px; color: #fff;">
      Different Types &amp; Styles of Hearing Aids
    </h1>
    <p style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; color: #d1fae5; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      From 100% invisible canal designs to high-power behind-the-ear instruments — discover the ideal style tailored to your ear anatomy, hearing loss degree, and lifestyle.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- The 4 Major Form Factors -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Form Factor Comparison</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">The 4 Major Hearing Aid Form Factors</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Understanding the differences in visibility, power, and everyday handling.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 30px;">
      <!-- Style 1: IIC -->
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 36px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);">Zero Visibility</span>
          <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem;">Mild to Moderate Loss</span>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 10px;">Invisible in Canal (IIC)</h3>
        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Rests past the second bend of your ear canal, making it completely undetectable from the outside. Utilizes the outer ear's natural acoustic funneling for lifelike sound localization.
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #334155; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li>✓ 100% invisible when worn</li>
          <li>✓ Ideal for active professionals</li>
          <li>✓ Requires good finger dexterity for small battery changes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Style 2: CIC -->
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 36px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);">Very Popular</span>
          <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem;">Mild to Moderately-Severe</span>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 10px;">Completely in Canal (CIC)</h3>
        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Custom-molded to fit securely inside the ear canal with only a tiny faceplate visible. Balances discrete cosmetic appearance with slightly larger amplifier power than IIC models.
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #334155; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li>✓ Highly discreet cosmetic profile</li>
          <li>✓ Includes removal cord for easy taking out</li>
          <li>✓ Great natural telephone use</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Style 3: RIC -->
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 36px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; background: #fef3c7; color: #b45309; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);">Global Best Seller</span>
          <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem;">Mild to Severe Loss</span>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 10px;">Receiver in Canal (RIC)</h3>
        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          The tiny casing hides comfortably behind the ear while an ultra-thin wire delivers sound straight to a soft dome speaker inside the canal. Delivers the most open, natural sound quality.
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #334155; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li>✓ Prevents plugged-up "occlusion" feeling</li>
          <li>✓ Full Bluetooth streaming and rechargeable batteries</li>
          <li>✓ Easy daily handling and maintenance</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Style 4: BTE -->
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 36px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; background: #fae8ff; color: #86198f; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill);">Maximum Power</span>
          <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem;">Moderate to Profound Loss</span>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 10px;">Behind the Ear (BTE / SuperPower)</h3>
        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Engineered for maximum acoustic output and durability, connecting to a custom earmould. The gold standard for children and individuals with severe-to-profound hearing loss.
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #334155; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li>✓ Maximum amplification gain &amp; feedback suppression</li>
          <li>✓ Robust water/dust resistance rating</li>
          <li>✓ Best choice for pediatric audiology fittings</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Selection Factors -->
<section class="section section-bg-light">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Fitting Methodology</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">How We Select Your Right Hearing Aid Style</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">1. Degree of Hearing Loss</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">More severe losses require larger speakers and robust acoustic seals provided by RIC or BTE with custom earmoulds.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">2. Ear Canal Anatomy</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Canal diameter, curvature, and wax production determine whether ultra-small IIC/CIC styles can be comfortably accommodated.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">3. Lifestyle &amp; Dexterity</h4>
        <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem;">Whether you prioritize discreetness, direct TV/phone Bluetooth streaming, or simple rechargeable dock charging.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 36px;">
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-open-appointment="uttara">Book Free Hearing Test &amp; Style Trial</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
